{"games":[{"id":7424863999,"name":"🎤Super Hero VS God Tycoon","desc":"🎤Spatial voice🎤\r\nYou can chat with each other via this way，Welcome to have a try~\r\n\r\nWelcome to the Super Hero VS God Tycoon! Where you can become one of the 16 superheroes and Gods, build up your Tycoon base to unspeakable size! Unlock special powers and items, battle other players, be the mightiest Tycoon!\r\n\r\n6000Likes SP Weapon Released!\r\nNext SP Weapon needs: 15k Likes\r\n\r\nLeave a Like and Favorite for more updates!","path":"/game/7424863999-super-hero-vs-god-tycoon","slug":"7424863999-super-hero-vs-god-tycoon","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/1f0cf2532f7c3d0f67b20858c2a2e6f209c2ef88c1506e610d00d12279f67ae3.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-312450dc6edb928dd8d19fdfc18a89a0/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":23402903,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-02-21T05:34:53.737Z","creator":{"name":"White Dragon Studio","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":12556232511,"name":"Noob Wars💥!","desc":"Conquer territories to earn money. Use your wealth to recruit troops, expand your army, and dominate all lands to maximize your earnings!\n\nIMPORTANT: If you’re experiencing lag issues, you can use the in-game settings to reduce them!\n\nTags: Defend, Conquer, WW2, WW3, Noobs, Battles, Attack, War","path":"/game/12556232511-noob-wars","slug":"12556232511-noob-wars","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/750594396be14b4d63952ac65d90b47cda44605eed5e119890b88a16e7724f9f.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-7daed22456d2e4e83962b5c9bb1ad83a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":8633628,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-10-09T13:33:59.759Z","creator":{"name":"W Puzzles","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":13663157896,"name":"Take and Hold","desc":"Rewrite is STILL on. We appreciate your support and patience.\n - Tails, 6/23/26\n\nPatch notes: https://devforum.roblox.com/t/take-and-hold-update-14/3317351\n\nWelcome to Take and Hold, a KoTH cooperation-based game where players compete on two teams alongside AI. Choose between 10 different Classes and harness their abilities in order to succeed on the battlefield. You can play this game by yourself, with friends, or in a full server! Private servers are free as well, so have fun.\n\nFeaturing:\n- Large scale PvPvE battles\n- Boss battles\n- 10 playable classes\n- Mobile compatibility\n- Free Private Servers + commands\n\nEverything in this game is being remade from the ground up. Do not consider this version the final product.\n\nIf you enjoy the game, donations are very much appreciated. If you cannot donate, send us your best wishes and cheer us on!","path":"/game/13663157896-take-and-hold","slug":"13663157896-take-and-hold","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/f2d3a6f03d7b12ec201f57ae0fdc5f493ab10ad3c98f85a65affaf8d524314d9.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6f044bfa7ae730a11abe81038b152832/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":2811503,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-04-26T12:06:43.097Z","creator":{"name":"Coolmapj's Clubhouse","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":9648883891,"name":"[BETA] Festival Tycoon ","desc":"Build your own music festival with The Chainsmokers’ Festival Tycoon. Along the way, you will explore the Islands, build a roller coaster, complete a daring quest and boogie it down while creating the most fantastic music festival ever!\r\n\r\n🎩 Earn incredible FREE avatar items \r\n\r\n🏆 Don't forget to like and favorite the game\r\n\r\n💃 Dance to your favorite Chainsmokers songs\r\n\r\n🛍️ Shop The Chainsmokers & other avatar accessories to show off your best festival apparel!\r\n\r\n🎮 Available for PC, XBOX, Tablet and Mobile\r\n\r\n💾 Don’t worry, all progress is autosaved so you can pick the party back up at any time!\r\n","pat