️ Become The Strongest!  \n\n🤔Lagging? USE A FREE VIP SERVER!! ❤️❤️❤️\n\n😍THANKS FOR 20K LIKES!!! USE CODE \"MyPetPlease\"\n\n👍NEW COMMUNITY REWARD at 25K LIKES! THANK YOU FOR THE SUPPORT ❤️\nUse the Code below for in-game rewards! \n\"PotionsFTW\" = x1 Of All Potions\n\n😲Premium Users Benefits: +1 Pet Equip, More Storage Pets","path":"/game/10549069562-weapon-crafting-simulator","slug":"10549069562-weapon-crafting-simulator","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/8bcc91d18dd04c2c88afed52666c4ce8b359fd956cb3a5eb8968cce8631a8fa9.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-0d6684e0f78dc7e97822127b03c17d56/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":63919052,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-01-24T14:05:51.496Z","creator":{"name":"Imaginationz Studio","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":10192723897,"name":"SCP: Facility Breach","desc":"SCP: Facility Breach is a casual round-based horror game that features many roles and factions to play as, with many possessing unique abilities! Massacre everyone as an anomalous entity, raid the facility as an invading insurgency, protect the Foundation as a Task Force soldier, lay waste to the EVERYTHING as Valravn, or simply evade and escape. It's up to you.\n\nCONTROLS\nDrop Item - (Keyboard: Q) (Controller: Down)\nSprint - (Keyboard: Left Shift) (Controller: Left Trigger)\nInteract - (Keyboard: E) (Controller: X)\n\nTags: SCP, Round-Based, Round Based, Facility, Breach, Contain, Containment Breach, SCP-049, SCP-457, SCP-106, SCP-035, SCP Site, Survive, Survival, Become an SCP, SCP Foundation, Guns, SCP Facility, SCP Laboratory, Escape, Class-D, Mobile Task Force, Chaos Insurgency, Plo, Monster, Monsters, Anomaly, Horror, Boss, Abilities","path":"/game/10192723897-scp-facility-breach","slug":"10192723897-scp-facility-breach","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/e0206f4fc3ea02a4277c8d56abaf5f781039521469bdde9542cfb7aba4590061.webp","original":"https